    <description>DECODED (v5, confidence LOW): FUN_2A5B8: fef00972 = map(RPM, final ignition fef01567). If throttle fef025FE is BELOW the map value (or a fault is present) a debounce (0x154308) clears fef009AE bit2 = OFF-THROTTLE; at or above it a debounce (0x154306) sets bit2 = ON-THROTTLE. That flag selects the On-Throttle or Off-Throttle shift-action profile (see "Quickshifter :: Shift Actions"). Used as a timing/load plausibility flag for the quickshift logic.

