    <title>Fuel Blend - MAP-&gt;Throttle Threshold (vs RPM)</title>
    <description>Throttle angle above which fueling ramps from the MAP (speed-density) path to the throttle (alpha-N) path over ~2.8 deg (FUN_491BC -&gt; weight fef011CA; final pulse = MAP*(256-w) + TPS*w). Stock 15-38 deg. On the SD-v2 bin all cells = 0xFFFF so the MAP path holds authority at all throttle openings. X = RPM (X/2.56).

SD-v4.1 VALUES: 180.00 to 180.00 deg throttle.

DIFFERS FROM STOCK 5JCZSJ40 in the SD-v4.1 bin (changed by the race software): free-text "stock" remarks above describe the stock calibration.</description>
