    <title>IAP - In Gear | Cyl 1 | Blend Map (inactive)</title>
    <description>Secondary IAP fuel map for cylinder 1.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_453B8 blends this map into the main map with a weight computed as clamp(0, 0..1024) = 0 (enable word 0x18262A is non-zero but the weight source is a constant 0), so in the stock code this map has no effect. Was "IAP - Mode A | Gear 2" in the DanCycles naming.

AXES: X axis: 30 points, 0.00 to 78.1 vacuum kPa; Y axis: 50 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

VALUES (stock SD-v4.1): 532 to 4872 raw (inj. time?).

TUNING NOTES: Editing this map does nothing on the stock code path.

CONFIDENCE: Confirmed from disassembly of FUN_453B8.

REFERENCE: data @0x15A7D4, X axis @0x155A5C, Y axis @0x15A770, descriptor @0x155A98, code FUN_45320.

 It is never used (blend weight is hard 0 - FUN_453B8 computes min(0,1024)).</description>
