    <description>Enable weight for the Boost Spark Retard maps. FUN_520E0 ramps fef01674 toward (this curve value) at 0x18B747/0x18B748 per 0x18B746 cycles, clamped 0..128; FUN_5271E: fef01575 = 64 + (map-64) x weight/128. Stock = 0 at all ECT (stock trim B unused). SD-v3 = 128 (100%) at all coolant temps so the boost retard map always applies.

REFERENCE: data @0x1828C0 (5 x 8-bit), X axis @0x1828B8 (ECT), descriptor @0x182E84, code FUN_520e0.

SD-v4.1 VALUES: 100 to 100 % of boost retard applied.

DIFFERS FROM STOCK 5JCZSJ40 in the SD-v4.1 bin (changed by the race software): free-text "stock" remarks above describe the stock calibration.</description>
