  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x113B" flags="0x0">
    <title>IGN :: Advance Timing - Cyl 1</title>
    <description>Base ignition advance for cylinder 1, throttle angle x RPM.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_52688 looks up the cylinder's map (pointer table 0x182AF8[cyl]); if option byte 0x18B72E = 2 the Cyl 1 map is used for all cylinders (stock 0x80 = per-cylinder). Result -&gt; RAM 0xFEF0154C[cyl].

