    <description>Lean-angle gain on the slip-error cut for TC level 3.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_4DDFC multiplies the "Cut vs Slip Error" result by this value / 100 at the current lean angle (RAM 0xFEF0268E). Forced to 100 % when slip error exceeds the per-level threshold 0x18B6E4.

AXES: X axis: 9 points, 0.00 to 60.0 deg (est.).

VALUES (stock SD-v4.1): 100 to 100 % of slip-error cut - every cell the same, so the function is probably disabled or unused in this calibration.

