  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1266" flags="0x0">
    <title>ETV Limit A | Neutral, Gears 1-2</title>
    <description>Throttle LIMIT map (cap) for N, 1st, 2nd.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_7C570 looks this map up via gear-indexed pointer table 0x18FD0C; FUN_7C944 applies it as min(limit, normal target) when ETV control state 0xFEF02AF2 = 1 (set by FUN_7C8F4 from status flags in the traction/anti-lift area). MARKET-SPECIFIC: values differ between 10L1 and 10L4. 

