    <title>Check Field A (ID block, file 0x1FFAFC)</title>
    <description>Field 1 (ID block 0x1FFAF4..0x1FFAFF): words 0x00010000 / 0x001FFAFB give the protected range; bytes 0x1FFAFE-0x1FFAFF = CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE (poly 0x1021, init 0xFFFF, no reflection, no xorout) over 0x10000-0x1FFAFB, stored BIG-endian. Verified on both stock bins and Do not hand-edit - recompute after any change.

DIFFERS FROM STOCK 5JCZSJ40 in the SD-v4.1 bin (changed by the race software): free-text "stock" remarks above describe the stock calibration.</description>
