  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9815" flags="0x0">
    <title>Per-Gear Limiter | 6th | Soft Cut start (TOP SPEED ~299 km/h)</title>
    <description>Per-gear RPM limiter FUN_2C068 (enabled by option 0x15444B = 0x80; skipped in 1st and 2nd). From word 1 up to word 2 the ECU sets 0xFEF009C6 bit0 = soft (pattern) fuel cut; at or above words 3 and 4 it sets bit1 = full fuel cut (FUN_4BAAE). STOCK 6th gear = 10,450 / 10,549 / 10,550 / 10,550 rpm - this is the factory ~299 km/h (186 mph) top-speed governor implemented as a 6th-gear RPM limit. Raise all four (keep the order) to remove it; gearing changes move the speed it acts at.

STOCK (SD-v4.1): 10450 RPM (raw 26752 / 0x6880).

