  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x982B" flags="0x0">
    <title>Partial-Cut Cylinder Mask</title>
    <description>Bit mask used by FUN_4B85E when the progressive limiter is in stages 1-3: bit1 = cyl 1, bit2 = cyl 2, bit3 = cyl 3, bit4 = cyl 4. STOCK 0x00 = no cylinders, so the progressive soft-cut does nothing.

STOCK (SD-v4.1): 0.00 raw (raw 0 / 0x0).

