    <title>Fuel-Cut Gear-Sensor Fault Limit (max)</title>
    <description>When the gear-position sensor reading is invalid (FUN_2C8E2 window checks) the ECU applies a limit from curve 0x1511EC vs rear-wheel speed, clamped between this value and the min below (FUN_2CB40).

STOCK (SD-v4.1): 11000 RPM (raw 28160 / 0x6E00).

