  <XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x983C" flags="0x0">
    <title>Launch Control | Level 1 | Use Launch TC/Anti-lift sets</title>
    <description>0x80 = while LC level 1 is active, switch traction control to its "Launch" curve set (FUN_28D30 -&gt; 0xFEF00702 bit6, used by the TC functions FUN_4D602 etc.) and anti-lift to its launch parameters 0x154340-0x154343 / 0x154480-0x154483 (FUN_28D8C -&gt; bit7, FUN_29BC4). Stock 0x00 = OFF for all levels, so stock LC uses the normal TC / anti-lift level.

STOCK (SD-v4.1): 0.00 raw (raw 0 / 0x0).

