  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x20003" flags="0x0">
    <title>Adaptive Fuel Trim :: Default Learned Values (Bank x Cell)</title>
    <description>FUN_48606 (start-up): when the Restore Mode for a bank is 0x80 the 16 learned fuel-trim cells of that bank (fef010E4[bank*16+cell]) are loaded from this table; mode 0x00 loads 1.0 (0x8000); other modes keep the stored learned value if it is within the valid range. 0x8000 = 1.00. Stock all 1.00.

REFERENCE: data 0x182714 (2 x 16 x 16-bit).</description>
