STOCK (SD-v4.1): 0x00 (monitor OFF). Several stock calibrations ship with many emissions monitors switched off.
ADDRESS 0x1549DF. Monitor code checks "byte == 0x80" (example: FUN_32A24 for P2123). Use a full byte value of 0x80 or 0x00 - other values also count as OFF.
Related: the lamp toggles in "Diagnostics - DTC Lamp Control" only hide the lamp; this switch stops the monitor itself.</description>
